# No DICOM binaries are versioned, including synthetic fixtures. The CI guard
# also checks renamed/extensionless files and archive contents.
*.[dD][cC][mM]
*.[dD][iI][cC][oO][mM]
*.[iI][mM][aA]
*.[dD][cC][mM][dD][aA][tT][aA]
[dD][iI][cC][oO][mM][dD][iI][rR]
